    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d436-f1" n="44" type="source" xml:id="d436-f1-content">
                <p>Reference is made to the United Nations Conference on Food and Agriculture, Hot
                    Springs, Virginia, May 18–June 3, 1943 (for documentation, see <ref
                        target="frus1943v01#pg_820">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1943, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 820</ref> ff.); the first session of
                    the Council of the United Nations Relief and Rehabilitation Administration, held
                    at Atlantic City, New Jersey, November 10–December 1, 1943 (for documentation,
                    see Department of State publication No. 2040, Conference Series No. 53: <hi
                        rendition="#italic">First Session of the Council of the United Nations
                        Relief and Rehabilitation Administration: Selected Documents</hi>
                    (Washington, 1944); and the United Nations Monetary and Financial Conference,
                    Bretton Woods. New Hampshire, July 1–22, 1944 (for documentation, see <ref
                        target="frus1944v02#pg_106">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1944, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, pp. 106</ref> ff.).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
